        "title": "fix(proxy-capture): wrap deletePathBasedSessions in transaction",
        "body": "Related: #98959\n\n## What Problem This Solves\nTwo DELETEs ran as separate auto-commit statements. A crash between them would leave tables inconsistent.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\nWrap both DELETEs in `runSqliteImmediateTransactionSync`, matching sibling `deleteSessions()`.\n\n## User Impact\nNo user-visible change. Prevents data inconsistency on crash.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-98852-proof.png)\n- Source verified: both DELETEs in single transaction, same helper as lines 336/608",
